Error [E0506]: `Tally<Float>` is not valid — `Float` is not hashable
  --> tally_unhashable.jet:3:23
    |
  3 |     t :: Tally<Float>.new()
    |                       ^^^
 Why: Tally elements must implement Hash and Eq; use Int, Bool, String, Char, or a named type
 Fix: Change the element type to a hashable type, or use a `[Float]` list instead
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0506
